<title>MEXICO: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>MEXICO GOVERNMENT LIST (961202)</p>
<p>  President (Sworn in 1 Dec 94)................Ernesto ZEDILLO</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>INSTITUTIONAL REVOLUTIONARY PARTY (PRI) GOVERNMENT</p>
<p> (Formed 1 Dec 1994, reshuffled 30 Dec 95)</p>
<p>	   **NOTE: All members of the cabinet are from the PRI</p>
<p>		     except environment minister Carabias who is</p>
<p>		     an Independent.</p>
<p>SECRETARIES OF STATE (MINISTERS):</p>
<p> Agrarian Reform............................Arturo WARMAN Gryj</p>
<p> Agriculture, Livestock &amp; Rural</p>
<p>    Development......................Francisco LABASTIDA Ochoa</p>
<p> Commerce &amp; Industrial Development.....Herminio BLANCO Mendoza</p>
<p> Communications &amp; Transport..............Carlos RUIZ Sacristan</p>
<p> Comptroller-General...................Arsenio FARELL Cubillas</p>
<p> Defence........................Gen. Enrique CERVANTES Aguirre</p>
<p> Education..................................Miguel LIMON Rojas</p>
<p> Energy....................................Jesus REYES Heroles</p>
<p> Environment, Natural Resources</p>
<p>    &amp; Fisheries.........................Julia CARABIAS Lillo**</p>
<p>							  (**See NOTE above)</p>
<p> Finance..............................Guillermo ORTIZ Martinez</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs.....................Jose Angel GURRIA Trevino</p>
<p> Health........................Juan Ramon DE LA FUENTE Ramirez</p>
<p> Interior..............................Emilio CHUAYFFET Chemor</p>
<p> Labour and Social Welfare...............Javier BONILLA Garcia</p>
<p> Navy........................Admiral Jose Ramon LORENZO Franco</p>
<p> Social Development.....................Carlos ROJAS Gutierrez</p>
<p> Tourism.............................Silvia HERNANDEZ Enriquez</p>
<p>				- - - - -</p>
<p>OTHER TOP OFFICIALS (NOT MINISTERS)</p>
<p> Mexico City Mayor....................Oscar ESPINOZA Villareal</p>
<p> Attorney-General of the Republic........Jorge MADRAZO Cuellar</p>
<p> Presidential Chief of Staff..............Luis TELLEZ Kuenzler</p>
<p> Chairman of Petroleos Mexicanos..........Adrian LAJOUS Vargas</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>Governor of the Central Bank</p>
<p>  (Banco de Mexico)......................Miguel MANCERA Aguayo</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
